WEBVTT

00:05:59.438 --> 00:06:02.691
the more we got to know
their distinct personalities

00:06:02.691 --> 00:06:04.402
and their gentle nature.

00:06:05.152 --> 00:06:06.737
It was very important for me

00:06:06.779 --> 00:06:09.657
that the aerobes
had their own sensory world.

00:06:10.783 --> 00:06:13.953
Most AI functions like a mind
without a body.

00:06:15.079 --> 00:06:16.956
But all living creatures,

00:06:16.956 --> 00:06:20.793
from the humble tick
to the stealthy panther,

00:06:20.793 --> 00:06:24.338
learn about the world
through their bodies and their senses.

00:06:25.214 --> 00:06:31.011
These aerobes perceive each other
through high-frequency radio waves,